#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A thoughtfully designed WordPress theme built for writers, developers, and independent creators who value clarity, performance, and a focused reading experience. It combines a clean, responsive design with essential tools for modern technical blogging, including light and dark modes, syntax-highlighted code blocks, table-of-contents navigation, related posts, hierarchical category browsing, and an integrated search sidebar. Designed with simplicity and usability at its core, the theme provides a refined foundation for publishing technical articles, tutorials, documentation, and personal knowledge."
msgstr ""

